  "term": "phase spectrum",
  "definition": "In this context, phase spectrum means the part of an image’s Fourier description that sets the sinusoidal pattern details making up edges, textures, and the arrangement of small object clusters. The packet indicates it has a major influence on how visually uncomfortable trypophobic images feel.",
